overage complete · Adds proof without interrupting the conversation.\nPlan whole clip\nNo story visual has enough spoken evidence yet.\nGenerate and review the multilingual transcript. The studio will keep the real speaker on screen instead of inventing generic B-roll.\nReview transcript\n＋\nUpload B-roll\nOne or multiple MP4, MOV or WEBM files\n🖼\nAttach an image\nTimed full screen, picture-in-picture or side by side\nSELECTED CUTAWAY\npodcast-12s.mp4\n0:02–0:04\nPlace at playhead\nPlay in timeline\nPlay B-roll only\nSTART\nDURATION (MM:SS)\n5 sec\n10 sec\n30 sec\n60 sec\n2 min\n5 min\nTo end\nUp to 0:10 remains after this start point. Type seconds, MM:SS, “2m” or “5:00”.\nUSE B-ROLL FROM\n4.6s\nChoose which moment inside the uploaded B-roll should play.\nWHEN B-ROLL FOOTAGE ENDS\nReturn to original\nLoop B-roll\nHold last frame\nThis source covers the complete 0:02 cutaway.\nPLACEMENT MODE\nOverwrite (Cover)\nInsert (Pause Main)\nMain video continues playing underneath this overlay.\nLAYOUT\nFull screen\nPicture-in-picture\nSide by side\nROUNDED FRAME\nCORNER CURVE\n28px\n✓ Smooth rounded corners match in preview and final export.\nCUTAWAY AUDIO\nKeep original\nUse overlay\nMix both\n✓ Original audio returns automatically after the cutaway.\n▣ Apply B-roll\n✓\n\nPicture-in-picture applied at 0:2.00.\n\nSplit\nTrim Start\nTrim End\nMore actions\nV\nSelect\nC\nRazor\nB\nRipple\nN\nRoll\nY\nSlip\nU\nSlide\nH\nHand\nShow empty tracks\n⌁ Snap\n⛓ Linked\n⇥ Ripple\n−\n+\nFit\n1×\n0:00\n0:02\n0:04\n0:06\n0:08\n0:10\n0:12\nV1\nSource video\n◉\n□\npodcast-12s.mp4\n12.0s\nV2\nB-roll\n◉\n□\nM\nS\npodcast-12s.mp4\nCC\nCaptions\n◉\n□\nSTUDIO QA CAPTION\newe iwayini iwayini iwayini iwayini iwayini iwayini · Review words\niwayini iwayini iwayini iwayini iwayini iwayini · Review words\nA2\nOriginal audio\n◉\n□\nM\nS\npodcast-12s.mp4 audio\nSelect Tool\nMagnetic Snapping\nAudio/Video Linked\n0:02",
